
@attribute [Route($"{GlobalValues.Root_path_CSS_Classes}/{GlobalValues.CSS_Path_Part_Font}/{GlobalValues.Common_Page_Path_Api}")]

<PageTitle>@GlobalValues.CSS_Name_Font @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Api_Usage</PageTitle>

<h1>@GlobalValues.CSS_Name_Font @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Api_Usage</h1>

<p>
    Everything you need to work with the <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">br-font-size-*</span> and <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">br-font-weight-*</span> CSS classes: the utility classes provided, the strongly-typed
    <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">Font</span> C# object used to apply them, and the supporting enums used to select a size and weight.
</p>

<h2 class="mobile-centred-heading">Overview</h2>

<p>
    <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">Font</span> is a <b>utility class</b>, not a BEM component class like <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">GridRow</span> or <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">FlexContent</span>.
    Rather than describing a block, element, or its variants, it sets a single CSS property per method - <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">font-size</span> or <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">font-weight</span> -
    to a fixed value. Utility classes are flat and single-purpose by design, so they can be freely combined with each other and with any other class - including component classes - on the same
    element, for example a larger, bolder heading.
</p>
<p>
    Both methods read from their own <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">--br-unit-*</span> primitive scale, defined in <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">BlazorRamp.Core</span>, so a theme change updates them
    automatically.
</p>
<p>
    <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">Font</span> doesn't provide a font family option. The project uses a single font family throughout, set once at the root level, so there's currently
    nothing to choose between.
</p>

<section>
    <h2 id="c#-classes" class="mobile-centred-heading">C# API</h2>
    <p>
        <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">Font</span> provides utility classes that set an element's font size and font weight.
    </p>
    <section>
        <h3 id="font-class" class="mobile-centred-heading">Font class</h3>
        <div class="@Section.Base @Section.NoPadding @Section.OverflowX(UnitScroll.Auto) @Padding.Block(UnitSpace.Four)">
            <table class="@Table.Base @Table.CodeTable" tabindex="0" aria-labelledby="font-class">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th scope="col">Return</th>
                        <th scope="col">Static Method</th>
                        <th scope="col">Description</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td>string</td>
                        <td>Font.Size(UnitFontSize unitFontSize)</td>
                        <td>Gets the class that sets an element's font size.</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>string</td>
                        <td>Font.Weight(UnitFontWeight unitFontWeight)</td>
                        <td>Gets the class that sets an element's font weight.</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </section>
</section>

