                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </section>
</section>

<section>
    <h2 class="mobile-centred-heading">Usage</h2>
    <p>the following example uses the <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">Font</span> utility to set both size and weight.</p>
    <p>
        This is a <span class="@Font.Size(UnitFontSize.Two) @Font.Weight(UnitFontWeight.Light)">font size of 2 with a weight of light (300)</span>
    </p>
    <p>
        This is a <span class="@Font.Size(UnitFontSize.Three) @Font.Weight(UnitFontWeight.SemiBold)">font size of 3 with a weight of semi-bold (600)</span>
    </p>
    <p>Code used for the above example</p>
    <CodeBox CodeBlock="@CssClassesSnippets.Font_Size_Weight_Examples" AriaLabel="Font size and weight code example." />
</section>

